Generated sources of the two PEG parsers, checked in; not regenerated by the
Makefile.  Built in docker ghcr.io/cakeml/pure:master from

  pure    d422b2987f6b81eb0064f0b99bb16abd80bfe6ac (2023-10-19)
  cakeml  d31b99f24aed144a39d8c6ea6af2d11b9862800b (2023-10-20)

by a HOL4 program `purebench` that extends PureCake's pure_parseProg (the
translated lexer and PEG parser) with printers and a command line:

  purebench tokens FILE        the tokens of PureCake's lexer, one per line:
                               class, row, column, payload (qstr-escaped)
  purebench ast FILE           the AST, as S-expression (or NOPARSE / NOAST)
  purebench parse FILE REPS    lexes once, parses REPS times

purebench.S          purebench compiled by the image's cake
                     (--sexp=true --exclude_prelude=true --skip_type_inference=true)
basis_ffi.c          CakeML's basis_ffi.c of that version; one change, marked
                     `bench/purecake`: open with a mode, which fortified glibc requires
purebench_poly.sml   the same CakeML program printed as Standard ML (everything
                     main reaches, basis modules included), on a runtime shim for
                     CakeML's FFI and byte-array primitives
